            "id": 126268,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>L'ordine delle istruzioni è importante perché il computer segue le istruzioni riga per riga.</p><p>Crea <code>step1</code>, poi <code>step2</code> e infine <code>step3</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" step1 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Collect pants&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" step2 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" step3 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Profit&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"64\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>let step1 = \"Collect pants\"</code>, seguito da <code>let step2 = \"?\"</code> e infine <code>let step3 = \"Profit\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
