            "id": 126269,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Con l'istruzione speciale <code>print()</code>, diciamo al computer di visualizzare un valore in un'area chiamata <strong>console</strong>.</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello, World!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"21\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, World!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>\"Hello, World!\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
